{"id": 39, "name": "Roger", "splash": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_32304eb469dc241a15e3d539584f62a9.png", "cls": ["Fighter", "Marksman"], "specialty": ["Finisher", "Burst"], "difficulty": "50", "stats": ["60", "40", "10", "50"], "lanes": ["Jungle", ""], "story": "A werewolf wandering in the dark forest longing for revenge.", "skills": [{"name": "Full Moon Curse", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_09769166146e91d618341d4a45dbbf70.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Roger can freely switch between human and wolf forms.\n\nIn human form, Roger's Basic Attack and skills deal additional damage equal to 4% of the target's current HP.\n\nIn wolf form, Roger's Basic Attack and skills deal additional damage equal to 4% of the target's lost HP.\n\nThis effect can only deal up to 60 additional damage against Creeps."}, {"name": "Open Fire", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_f6a7a6f89ad205b579985ea0e5ac28a1.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 23, "tagname": "Debuff", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 7   Mana Cost: 50", "desc": "Roger fires two quick shots in the target direction, dealing 250<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+125% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> in total to the enemy hit. The first shot is a hunter net that slows the enemy by 80% for 1.5s, while the second is a bullet that reduces the enemy's Physical Defense by 10 for 5s."}, {"name": "Hunter's Steps", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_42cfcbb066e1aef866c0cc1b9221811a.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 61, "tagname": "Speed Up", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 10   Mana Cost: 50", "desc": "Roger gains 20% Movement Speed and 20% Attack Speed for 2.5s."}, {"name": "Wolf Transformation", "icon": "http